{"chapters":[{"title":"Simulate with a list and deletions","code":"def predict_party_victory(senate):\n    s = list(senate)\n    i = 0\n    while len(set(s)) > 1:\n        me = s[i]\n        j = i + 1\n        while s[j % len(s)] == me:\n            j += 1\n        j %= len(s)\n        del s[j]\n        if j < i:\n            i -= 1                               # removal shifted our position\n        i = (i + 1) % len(s)\n    return \"Radiant\" if s[0] == \"R\" else \"Dire\"","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Simulate with a list and deletions</strong> &mdash; O(n&sup2;) time, O(n) extra space. Input: <code>predict_party_victory(senate='DDRRR')</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"senate","label":"senate","v":["D","D","R","R","R"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["senate","'DDRRR'",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>s = list(senate)</code> &mdash; <code>s = ['D', 'D', 'R', 'R', 'R']</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"s","label":"s","v":["D","D","R","R","R"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["senate","'DDRRR'",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>i = 0</code> &mdash; <code>i = 0</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"s","label":"s","v":["D","D","R","R","R"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["senate","'DDRRR'",0],["i","0",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>while len(set(s)) &gt; 1:</code> &rarr; <strong>true</strong>","line":4,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"s","label":"s","v":["D","D","R","R","R"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["senate","'DDRRR'",0],["i","0",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>me = s[i]</code> &mdash; <code>me = 'D'</code>","line":5,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"s","label":"s","v":["D","D","R","R","R"],"cls":["src","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}}],"vars":[["senate","'DDRRR'",0],["i","0",0],["me","'D'",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>j = i + 1</code> &mdash; <code>j = 1</code>","line":6,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"s","label":"s","v":["D","D","R","R","